WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Walk down any street.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:07.830
The shops, the houses, the people:
each has a story no map tells.

3
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:10.590
Elephant and Castle, in Southwark, London.

4
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:15.470
In 2012, a researcher began a blog
about Latin Americans in the area.

5
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:20.450
On 24 September 2020, the
area's shopping centre closed.

6
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.470
A year later, a digital archive
of the area was launched.

7
00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.730
So how do you uncover what
made a place what it is?

8
00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:30.110
Are old photos enough?

9
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:33.890
In this mission, you'll profile
a place through six lenses.

10
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:38.350
Then you'll trace the flows that tie
one neighbourhood to the wider world.

11
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.840
Your mission: find out how to uncover
what made your own place what it is.
